linux-asahi-arm (6.16.0-1001.1) questing; urgency=medium

  * Packaging resync (LP: #1786013)
    - [Packaging] update variants
    - [Packaging] resync git-ubuntu-log
    - [Packaging] debian.asahi-arm/dkms-versions -- update from kernel-
      versions (main/d2023.05.29)

  * sources list generation using dwarfdump takes up to 0.5hr in build process
    (LP: #2104911)
    - [Packaging] asahi-arm: Don't generate list of source files

  * arm64: kernel image cannot be booted in UEFI despite EFI stub and ZBOOT
    (LP: #2098111)
    - [Packaging] asahi-arm: Install compressed vmlinuz.efi on arm64

  * Miscellaneous Ubuntu changes
    - [Packaging] asahi-arm: Rebasing to Questing
    - [Packaging] asahi-arm: debian.master/control.stub.in: prepare for cross-
      compiling
    - [Config] asahi-arm: updateconfigs for v6.16.3

